4. Known blocking items
================================================================================

None at present. The dependency audit (licenses/NOTICE_AUDIT.md §1) originally
found three copyleft dependencies inherited from upstream (a GPL-2.0 trie linked
into every server binary, an AGPL-3.0 EPUB library and an LGPL-2.1 encoding
detector); all three were replaced or removed on 2026-09-18. The audit records
what was done. tools/license_check.sh fails the build if a new one appears.
